# Maxwell Control: let the logged-in user open the HID control interface of Audeze devices
# (USB vendor 0x3329) without root. "uaccess" grants access to whoever is logged in at the
# seat; it is not world-writable. Must sort before 73-seat-late.rules, hence the 70- prefix.
#
# Covers every Audeze product id on purpose: the Maxwell 2 ANC's USB-C product id has not been
# published anywhere, so a list of ids could miss it.
KERNEL=="hidraw*", SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="3329", TAG+="uaccess"
